{
  "name": "@konxyz/runtime",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "KON v2 Public Runtime — browser SPA (Vite + Preact + @preact/signals) that resolves ENS contenthash → fetches the per-app entry → loads the shared runtime + manifest from IPFS → renders pages and plugins. Replaces apps/pwa (CF Workers SSR) with a static, IPFS-hostable bundle.",
